	(text "DEV PORT (own 3V3_DEV domain from Dev VBUS; works with the target unpowered):\nUSB-C -> USBLC6 -> USB2514B hub (strap defaults, bus powered). DN1 P4 USB-Serial/JTAG, DN2 disabled (C5 USB = SDIO pins),\nDN3 FT2232HL: A = P4 UART0, B = C5 UART0, DTR/RTS -> MMBT3904 pairs (esptool auto-reset) on P4_EN/BOOT and C5_EN/BOOT.\nDN4 RP2040 + W25Q16 running the STOCK ADSBee 1421 Programmer: GPIO26 ~SRST, 27 SYNC, 28 TX, 29 RX, 16 WS2812 status.\nNo back-powering: Dev->target UART via open-drain 74LVC1G07 (target pull-ups), target->Dev via 74LVC1G125 (Ioff),\nm1421 lines via 74LVC1G125 into the target's LVC logic. Remove R1037/R1038 for a console-only Dev port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 406.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
